                      },
                      "block_order": [
                        "text_cb7JpE"
                      ]
                    },
                    "accordion_row_tmQUdF": {
                      "type": "_accordion-row",
                      "settings": {
                        "heading": "The Science Behind It",
                        "open_by_default": false,
                        "icon": "none",
                        "width": 20
                      },
                      "blocks": {
                        "text_Ck8PUJ": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "text": "<p>Rootbase nattokinase contains the same class of enzyme studied in landmark cardiovascular research - including a 12-month study with 1,062 participants that observed meaningful improvements in arterial wellness markers.</p><p>But nattokinase alone isn't enough. Circulation and cardiovascular health aren't one-problem issues — they involve blood flow, inflammation, and vessel support all at once. Targeting only one piece leaves the root cause untouched.</p><p>That's why we built a formula around it, not just with it. Rootbase pairs 5,000 FU of enteric-coated nattokinase with 7 supporting ingredients — CoQ10, Bromelain, Turmeric, Ginger, Olive Leaf, and White Willow Bark — each targeting a different piece of the cardiovascular and circulation puzzle: healthy blood flow, inflammation, and vessel support working together.</p>",
                            "width": "100%",
                            "max_width": "normal",
                            "alignment": "left",
                            "type_preset": "custom",
                            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                            "font_size": "0.875rem",
                            "font_size_mobile": "",
                            "weight": "",
                            "line_height": "normal",
                            "letter_spacing": "normal",
