                      "blocks": {
                        "text_gRkjrB": {
                          "type": "text",
                          "settings": {
                            "text": "<p>We're confident our Nattokinase Softgels will help you improve circulation, restore energy, and feel like yourself again, but we want you to be 100% sure.</p><p>That's why every order is backed by our <strong>60-Day Money-Back Guarantee.</strong></p><p>If you don't feel a difference simply reach out within 60 days and we'll refund every penny. <strong>No questions asked. No hassle.<br/><br/></strong>Support email: <strong>support@trypridewell.com</strong></p>",
